  {
   "id": "LB62qBMK2DXdrbry",
   "type": "text",
   "top": 1048.1,
   "left": 85.8,
   "w": 370,
   "h": 150.6,
   "runs": [
    {
     "text": "Inspired by the iconic device from Fallout, the Pip-Boy reimagines a ",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": "fictional wearable as a functional everyday product. ",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "bold",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": "Combining its recognizable retro-futuristic design with practical features such as ",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": "timekeeping, temperature and humidity monitoring, and an integrated in-game radio,",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "bold",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": " it bridges the gap between gaming memorabilia and functional product design.\n",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    }
   ]
  },
