  {
   "id": "LBtnClDdzkTLxr43",
   "type": "text",
   "top": 2046.5,
   "left": 615.2,
   "w": 280.2,
   "h": 122.4,
   "runs": [
    {
     "text": "The Pip-Boy is one of gaming's most recognizable props, ",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": "but it's mostly bought to be looked at:",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "bold",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": " a collectible or cosplay accessory ",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": "with little use once the event is over. ",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "bold",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": "Fans own a piece of the Fallout world, yet it usually just sits on a shelf.",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "LBcZ0hM7pQ6BXNjq",
   "type": "text",
   "top": 2046.5,
   "left": 940.9,
   "w": 280.2,
   "h": 156.4,
   "runs": [
    {
     "text": "MY FIRST PLAN was a wearable, but the ",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": "electronics I wanted wouldn't fit inside at that size",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "bold",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": ", and cutting features to make it fit defeated the purpose. I redesigned it as a ",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": "desktop clock",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "bold",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": " that keeps the retro-futuristic look and gives fans three daily uses: ",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": "telling time, monitoring temperature and humidity, and playing in-game radio.",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "bold",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    }
   ]
  },
